<description>&lt;p&gt;Libya’s leadership transition continues to reshape power dynamics, with a recent change in leadership signaling a major shift. The military seized narcotics after a firefight with smugglers, while an explosion at a munitions depot in Misrata has revived scrutiny of political decisions by Dbeibah and Zoubi. Turkey is expanding its security strategy in Libya, increasing its involvement in the conflict. Restoration work on an Ottoman-era mosque in Tajoura is proceeding under the Historic Cities Authority. The UCDP recorded two battle‑related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1kTEx4ZEtub3pqdHBBSkJiTVFqWGtNcGlYLTYyX2NhU3BuRUc4M0VNcTNpbURvMkVKU2ZPaFEzMWNhUVlHc0VFSUJtaHFTVUFYWlBtSGtVbzduQkVQRWRr?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPSmdQOWpFZzBLYmhfOWloUk1COEpyNUdJZ0xOQWYzalFXRm5GOXJPYnM3NkZEVGhqTDNOWVVlcUNkTDhmYml6Zm1fQUwwakttOEo2Uklaa0Jkdkh0Uzk5M0NOeUhrMFFMbkpNNlZmb2pod20zTDBRSURYOUw3QldtOURoVG4yWllpVDEwRmFPN0RIWTgy?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQMjBscGotdnozMDgyM21tdXhNaFVKREVoV2hqcWg4NGZZdVNLY21XVC16dVRMYjk1ZVMzeXFkejg0TXlVMmFxc0Y5VmtkWmJNc0RmX2Vmc1F6WVlRNTdkR0dORXlVYmF4UWFSVng5cFRtd0J1b2NFalJkUXcxbUZTVTRTMC12TUpiQXow?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQZG9rRVpyczJ6cXBsVmdDUzZYMGk4MUxONUw1RXlHOWhwLU1aMDZWZnJWVG5sRTJQNXNueWNoUEFnT1dBODVhdF9JeG5LQURZSERtYWlEMXV0YmlUVi1FT3M0VG42NlBBeEduNGpBeHlHZnRxbmt5dXI5azgtcjkyWHh6MS1EenhFNjRyZ0h5ZW15OGpTMzhoV192eUtpVGdsVFdmaVBaUTc2eElyd0lrRGNWYVBqWlp6SkZzYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Libya Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNckZPdVVNd0hvNzA5cXBNZm9HODR3b2xDNm5JbmJ4RTdJ